# Vercel uploads the whole repo when you deploy from the root (Root Directory = web) and it does NOT
# read .gitignore. Allowlist only what the site build needs, so .env (the Context.dev key), .venv/
# and the scrape cache never leave this machine.
/*
!web
!data
!contract
data/*
!data/burger_index.json
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
web/.env*
